{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "header",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -360,
      "width": 3280,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "# 导数与求导\n\n从差商极限建立局部变化率，再由函数结构选择规则；指数、对数与双曲函数沿反函数和链式法则接入。\n\n**连续阅读：** [[01_Math/01_calculus/01_导数与求导|导数与求导：从差商极限到指数与对数]]",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "group-definition",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -80,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 3280,
      "height": 500,
      "label": "1 · 什么是导数，它何时存在",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "limit",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[函数极限]]\n\n先有趋近语言，才能询问差商在增量趋零时是否稳定。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "derivative",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 480,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## [[导数]]\n\n$ f'(x_0)=\\lim_{h\\to0}[f(x_0+h)-f(x_0)]/h $；切线、瞬时率与局部线性系数是同一对象。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "diff-cont",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[可导必连续|Differentiability implies continuity]]\n\nA finite derivative at a point makes the output increment tend to zero there. Continuity is a necessary condition for differentiability.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n一点的有限导数使该处输出增量趋零；连续是可导的必要条件。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "cont-not-diff",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1440,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 290,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[连续不必可导|The converse fails]]\n\nAbsolute value is continuous at zero, but its left and right difference quotients differ. An infinite limiting slope also fails the finite-derivative requirement.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n绝对值在零点连续，左右差商却不同；斜率趋于无穷同样不满足有限导数要求。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "group-rules",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -80,
      "y": 620,
      "width": 3280,
      "height": 580,
      "label": "2 · 差商如何压缩成求导规则",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "linear",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 730,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[导数线性法则|Linearity of differentiation]]\n\nFor differentiable functions and constant coefficients, finite linear combinations differentiate term by term.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n有限个可导函数的常系数线性组合可逐项求导；无穷和需要额外条件。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "power-int",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 450,
      "y": 730,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[整数幂求导|Integer powers]]\n\nPositive integer powers differentiate on all real inputs. Negative integer powers exclude zero. The constant function $1$ has derivative zero.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n正整数幂在全实域求导，负整数幂排除零；常数函数 1 的导数单独为零。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "sine-limit",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 730,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[正弦基本极限|The basic sine limit]]\n\nIn radians, $\\sin h/h\\to1$ by geometric squeezing; the degree-based limit includes $\\pi/180$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n先用弧度制面积夹逼，再处理负侧；角度单位会改变比例因子。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "trig-derivative",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1350,
      "y": 730,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[正弦余弦求导|Sine and cosine derivatives]]\n\nAngle addition and two-sided small-angle limits give $(\\sin x)^\\prime=\\cos x$ and $(\\cos x)^\\prime=-\\sin x$ in radians.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n和角公式配合双侧小角极限；弧度制决定标准斜率。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "product",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1800,
      "y": 730,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[乘积法则|Product rule]]\n\nFor differentiable $u,v$, $(uv)'=u'v+uv'$: each factor contributes one first-order change.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n两个因子各贡献一项一阶变化；高阶交叉变化在差商极限中消失。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "quotient",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2250,
      "y": 730,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[商法则|Quotient rule]]\n\nFor differentiable $u,v$ with $v\\ne0$, prove the reciprocal differentiable by its difference quotient, then apply the product rule.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n先由差商证明非零分母的倒数可导，再使用乘积法则。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "chain",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2700,
      "y": 730,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[链式法则|Chain rule]]\n\nIf $u=g(x)$ and $y=f(u)$ are differentiable at the corresponding inputs, multiply $f'(g(x))$ by $g'(x)$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n内外两层在对应输入处可导，外导数在内层取值处计算，再乘以内导数。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "group-extensions",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -80,
      "y": 1320,
      "width": 3280,
      "height": 590,
      "label": "3 · 反复求导、隐式关系与反函数",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "higher",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[高阶导数|Higher derivatives]]\n\n$f^{(n)}$ means $n$ successive differentiations, with $f^{(0)}=f$. One derivative does not guarantee the next.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n上标括号表示求导次数，不是函数幂；每增加一阶都需确认存在。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-product",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[高阶乘积法则|Leibniz rule]]\n\nIf both factors have derivatives through order $n$, binomial coefficients count how $n$ differentiations are allocated.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n两个因子都需有直到n阶的导数；二项系数记录各阶导数如何配对。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "implicit",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[隐式求导|Implicit differentiation]]\n\nAlong a differentiable solution branch, apply the chain rule to dependent variables and the product rule to mixed products.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n沿可导解支求导；复合项使用链式法则，混合乘积还需使用乘积法则。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "implicit-formula",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[隐函数导数公式|The implicit derivative]]\n\nUnder the local $C^1$ theorem and an invertible dependent-variable block, $Dg=-(D_vF)^{-1}D_uF$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n先核对解支存在条件与矩阵尺寸，再从左侧求逆；奇异块不能直接使用此公式。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "inverse",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2000,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[反函数导数|Inverse derivatives]]\n\nFor a continuous local inverse of a function differentiable with nonzero derivative, the inverse derivative is its reciprocal at the matching point.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n原函数在该点可导且导数非零，局部反函数连续时，反函数导数是对应点原导数的倒数。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "inverse-trig",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2500,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[反三角函数求导|Inverse trigonometric derivatives]]\n\nPrincipal ranges fix signs; arcsine and arccosine have finite derivatives only inside (-1,1). Arctangent is differentiable on the real line.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n主值范围决定符号；反正弦/反余弦端点没有有限导数，反正切在实轴可导。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "group-explog",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -80,
      "y": 2030,
      "width": 3280,
      "height": 1120,
      "label": "4 · 指数、对数、实数幂与双曲函数",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "exponential",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2140,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[指数函数|Exponential function]]\n\nFor fixed $a>0$, $a^x$ extends repeated multiplication to real $x$. Equal input increments multiply output by a fixed factor.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n底数 $a>0$ 固定：输入等量增加，输出乘以固定倍数。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "natural-exp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 480,
      "y": 2140,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[自然指数函数|Natural exponential]]\n\n$E(x)=e^x$ has $E(0)=1$ and $E'=E$: its slope equals its current value.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n自然指数的斜率等于当前函数值，且零处取一。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "natural-log",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 2140,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[自然对数|Natural logarithm]]\n\n$\\ln:(0,\\infty)\\to\\mathbb R$ reverses $\\exp:\\mathbb R\\to(0,\\infty)$. It gives the exponent needed to reach a positive value.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n自然对数把正的指数结果还原成所需指数。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "exp-derivative",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1440,
      "y": 2140,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[指数函数求导|Differentiating exponentials]]\n\nFor fixed $a>0$, $\\frac{d}{dx}a^x=(\\ln a)a^x$. A differentiable exponent $u(x)$ adds the factor $u'(x)$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n底数固定时乘以 $\\ln a$；复合指数要求内层可导，再乘内层导数。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "log-derivative",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1920,
      "y": 2140,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[对数函数求导|Differentiating logarithms]]\n\n$\\frac{d}{dx}\\ln x=1/x$ on $x>0$. For differentiable $u$ with $u(x)>0$, $\\frac{d}{dx}\\ln u(x)=u'(x)/u(x)$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n定义域随公式一起检查；复合对数要求内层可导，再乘内层导数。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "log-diff",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 2140,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[对数求导|Logarithmic differentiation]]\n\nFor differentiable $y\\ne0$ on an interval, differentiate $\\ln\\lvert y\\rvert$ to obtain $y'/y$, then multiply by $y$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n在函数可导且非零的区间上，先对绝对值取对数并求导，再乘回原函数。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "real-power",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2630,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[实数幂求导|Real powers]]\n\nFor fixed real $r$ and $x>0$, define $x^r=e^{r\\ln x}$ and differentiate to get $rx^{r-1}$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n固定实数指数且输入为正时，用指数与对数定义实幂并求导；负输入另查实根分支。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "e-limit",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 480,
      "y": 2630,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 320,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[自然常数极限|A limit for e]]\n\nFor positive integers $n$, $(1+1/n)^n\\to e$. Taking logarithms gives the difference quotient of $\\ln$ at $1$; continuity of $\\exp$ then recovers the limit.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n正整数 $n$ 趋于无穷时，$(1+1/n)^n\\to e$。先取对数识别输入 $1$ 处的差商，再由指数连续性返回；不能只看底数趋一。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "hyperbolic",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 2630,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 330,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[双曲函数|Hyperbolic functions]]\n\nFor real $x$, $\\sinh x=(e^x-e^{-x})/2$ and $\\cosh x=(e^x+e^{-x})/2$. They are respectively odd and even, with $\\cosh^2x-\\sinh^2x=1$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n对实数 $x$，指数之差的一半是双曲正弦，和的一半是双曲余弦；分别为奇、偶函数，并满足平方差为一。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "hyperbolic-derivative",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1440,
      "y": 2630,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 330,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[双曲函数求导|Hyperbolic derivatives]]\n\nFor every real $x$, $(\\sinh x)^{\\prime}=\\cosh x$ and $(\\cosh x)^{\\prime}=\\sinh x$. Differentiate the exponential definitions; a differentiable inner input $g(x)$ contributes $g^{\\prime}(x)$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n实轴上两种基本双曲函数求导后互换，余弦这一条没有负号。对可导内层 $g(x)$，复合求导还须乘 $g^{\\prime}(x)$。",
      "color": "5"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
